agents plugins update — Update plugins across harnesses

USAGE
  agents plugins update [options]

OPTIONS
  -dry-run
    	dry-run mode
  -f	force mode
  -file string
    	path to harness.toml
  -force
    	force mode
  -harness string
    	target harness (antigravity, claude, codex, etc.)
  -harness-dir string
    	path to plugin registry repository checkout
  -json
    	output JSON format
  -n	dry-run mode (inspect only, do not modify)
  -h, --help
    Show this help and exit.

DEFAULTS
  Discovers harness.toml; -n previews changes; -f forces updates.

ENVIRONMENT
  HARNESS_DIR: registry checkout; CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR, HOME: configuration discovery.

EXAMPLES
  agents plugins update -n
